        "why": "Writing the two reaction sites beside the drawing costs one line and answers the follow-up question an examiner most often asks about this figure.",
        "common_mistakes": [
          "Labelling the whole inside 'stroma' and stopping. The grana and lamellae are separate labels.",
          "Swapping the reaction sites. Light reaction is in the GRANA, dark reaction in the STROMA."
